WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.188
Lab 1 needs only a laptop
with PowerShell 7 and Pester.

2
00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:08.288
First you lint the rule table
from the HR-Driven Identity book.

3
00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:12.819
Two rows come back: a finding on the
rule that reads a display-name attribute

4
00:00:12.819 --> 00:00:14.207
instead of a coded slot,

5
00:00:14.207 --> 00:00:17.862
and a note on the direct reports
rule, which can't carry guards.

6
00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:21.013
Then you evaluate a rule
over the fictional people.

7
00:00:21.013 --> 00:00:24.900
The disabled account and the guest
stay out, because of the guards,

8
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.270
and the lower-case code gets
in, just as Learn says it will.
